    "title": "Doug Ghim ties for 15th for Des Plaines at Rocket Classic on Aug. 2",
    "text": "Doug Ghim ties for 15th for Des Plaines at Rocket Classic on Aug. 2\nBy\nA. G. WilksDoug Ghim represented Des Plaines, Illinois at the PGA Tour's Rocket Classic, which concluded Sunday, Aug. 2.\nGhim provided the area's best result, tying for 15th at 269, 11 under par.\nHe recorded rounds of 65, 67, 70 and 67. The Des Plaines golfer played college golf at the University of Texas.\nMichael Thorbjornsen won the tournament at 262, 18 under par; Xander Schauffele was second at 264, 16 under par, and Davis Riley finished third at 265, 15 under par.",
    "summary": "Doug Ghim ties for 15th for Des Plaines at Rocket Classic on Aug. 2 A. G. WilksDoug Ghim represented Des Plaines, Illinois at the PGA Tour's Rocket Classic, which concluded Sunday, Aug. 2. Ghim provided the area's best result, tying for 15th at 269, 11 under par. He recorded rounds of 65, 67, 70 and 67. The Des Plaines golfer played college golf at the University of Texas. Michael Thorbjornsen won the tournament at 262, 18 under par; Xander Schauffele was second at 264, 16 under par, and Davis Riley finished third at 265, 15 under par.",
